# Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com, then:
# 1. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> copy its Service ID
# 2. Create an Email Template with variables: from_name, from_email, message, to_name -> copy its Template ID
# 3. Find your Public Key under Account -> General
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values below. Restart `npm run dev` after.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
